    <li>If you insist on <strong>zero chat apps</strong>, downgrade hubs that narratively bind freshness or coupons to Discord participation.</li>
    <li>If you multi-home agents, scrutinise <strong>dual-button UX</strong> slowly—mis-clicks reroute you into an entirely different wallet ecosystem.</li>
    <li>If you audit provenance, favour hubs whose disclosures articulate affiliate mechanics plainly—even when the disclosure lengthens the footer.</li>
  </ul>

